Para. 2bis — Inserted by No I of the FA of 13 June 2008 (AS 2008 4873, 2010 4027; BBl 2007 2393). Amended by No I of the FA of 18 March 2016, in force since 1 Jan. 2019 (AS 2017 2745, 2018 3575; BBl 2013 1).
|

:NOTE
